  {
    "id": 2006006020010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "はぁ……素晴らしいひとときだったよ\r\nプロデューサー、今日は連れてきてくれてありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040060020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。次の仕事でお世話になる監督の舞台だからな\r\nぜひ咲耶にも見てもらいたかったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "とても素敵な物語だったね\r\n夢中で舞台にかぶりついてしまったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "脚本も演出も素晴らしかったが\r\n……特に、主演の三姉妹がとても良かった",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "物静かな長女、女性的な次女、気が強い三女……\r\nみんなとても魅力的だったな",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、三人三様の個性が光っていたな\r\n主演の三人がいるだけで、舞台が違って見えたよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。そうだね……\r\n私も彼女たちの演技に、つい引き込まれてしまったよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『運命は変えられません……\r\nだから、流されるしかないのです』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！\r\n今のは、長女か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。ご明察だよ\r\nじゃあ次は──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020070"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『運命は、きっと誰かが変えてくれる\r\n……私はその時を、待ち続けます』",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（これは次女だな……表情や身振り、声まで……\r\n女性らしさが一段と際立っている）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『運命なんて変えてみせる\r\n私は、従いはしないっ……！』",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（三人の特徴を捉えてしっかりと演じ分けている……\r\nまるで、本当に三姉妹が目の前にいるみたいだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やはり、咲耶には芝居が向いていそうだな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "作り手やお客さんが求める姿を素早く理解し、適応できる……\r\n咲耶の持つ天性の才能だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。嬉しいことを言ってくれるね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……でも、そうだね\r\n自分ではない誰かを演じるのは、とても魅力的だ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "自分以外の誰かの心を……世界を\r\nこの身に宿すようでとても面白いよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そして『私でない私』でみんなを楽しませることができる\r\n……とても興味深いことでもあるね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もし叶うのなら、\r\n今日観たような舞台にもいつか挑戦してみたい",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ストレートプレイだけでなく、\r\nミュージカルや朗読劇も楽しめそうだね。それに──",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……っと。すまない\r\n私ばかり喋りすぎてしまったかな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020160"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しそうだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "見てみたいな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "きっとみんなも\r\n待っている",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、きっとみんなも楽しめるものになるよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それもあるが\r\nきっと咲耶自身も楽しめるんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私自身が楽しむ、か……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私はみんなが楽しんでくれさえすれば\r\nそれで充分なのだけれども……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶自身が楽しむことも、\r\nみんなを楽しませるには大事なことだと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは一理あるかもしれないな\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "自分自身が楽しむ、という感覚……\r\nあまり自分ではわからないし、未知数だけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私が楽しむことで、みんなが楽しんでくれるのなら、\r\nそれはきっと、この上なく嬉しいことなのだろうね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。私もぜひプロデューサーに\r\n私が演じている姿を見てほしいよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まずは小さなハコからがいい\r\nそして一番初めの観客は、プロデューサー……アナタがいいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは光栄だな……\r\n今から楽しみだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、きっとプロデューサーを\r\n満足させる舞台にしてみせるよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "花のような乙女、冷酷な騎士……\r\nプロデューサーはどんな私をご所望かな？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタが望むなら\r\nきっとなんだって演じ切って見せるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。そうだと嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら、待ってくれているみんなが楽しめるように\r\n私も演技の幅を広げられるよう、努力しなくてはね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "無骨な青年に美しい貴婦人……\r\nみんなはどんな演技をする私を望むだろうか",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ねぇ、プロデューサーは\r\nどんな役を演じればみんなを喜ばせられると思う？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶が演じるのなら\r\nきっとなんだって嬉しいはずさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、随分と自信ありげのようだが\r\nどうしてそう思うんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶にピッタリの、かっこいい役なんかはもちろん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "演技でないと見られない、\r\n咲耶らしくない役だって喜ばれると思うからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど\r\n『演技でないと見られない私』か……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら、みんなが喜んでくれるよう\r\n私はなんだって演じてみせよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006020350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そして舞台の上で幾度も生まれ変わる私を\r\nみんなに楽しんでもらいたいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600602/2006006020350"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]